  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: Equations of line,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, we know that shortest distance between two lines is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>S.D</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>·</mo><mover><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Hence, the sum is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p>",
